DamienSo far this is very nice! Great work! Few comments for now:
 - we need better icon in for dark theme. @niels9001 can help here
 ![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57057282/179259339-5e1c9122-b190-4ccb-8b24-1f9efe21d232.png)
