reviews_text:
Overall, great work! Some minor things to be fixed..

And one Q: Can we do something about the background? While previewing sample files, I see that .png files are previewed without the background, while qoi files have white background. Is it possible to remove the background? Same as fir thumbnails, thumbnails don't have background.

Also, the last file from test images (wikipedia_008.qoi) is cut when previewed. Let's try to fix that. Yes, everything works perfectly now! Very nice! I just triggered the release CI build to make sure everything is ok there as well. I just tested release CI build, everything works as expected. I did notice white flash when previewing qoi file with dark OS theme. To fix this I believe QoiPreviewHandlerCpp SetBackgroundColor should look like this:

```
IFACEMETHODIMP QoiPreviewHandler::SetBackgroundColor(COLORREF color)
{
    HBRUSH brush = CreateSolidBrush(WindowsColors::is_dark_mode() ? powerpreviewConstants::DARK_THEME_COLOR : powerpreviewConstants::LIGHT_THEME_COLOR);
    SetClassLongPtr(m_hwndParent, GCLP_HBRBACKGROUND, reinterpret_cast<LONG_PTR>(brush));
    return S_OK;
}
``` Tested again, all good. Once again, nice work! Thanks!

