LGTM

I found a way to freeze PT with a quick-switch. I have all FZ options on excluding spanning zones across monitors.

* Assign window to a zone
* Quick-switch to another layout
* Try to assign a window to another zone.

The window doesn't change size corresponding to the zone, layouts are not shown if you drag the window with a shift pressed.
After PT restart window immediately fits the new zone size.   Another thing I noticed that when you have `Flash zones` on, it flashes on both monitors only the first time. After that zones are flashing on one monitor after another in turn. It looks weird when you switch to the layout on the first monitor and you see only another layout on the other monitor.
And I think it could be a frequent use case. Let's say if I don't keep in mind which key I assigned to the desired layout and I'll quickly check several until I get the right one.  @SeraphimaZ 

