[2021-02-05 17:27:04.0732] [INFO] [Wox.Infrastructure.Image.ImageLoader+<>c.Initialize] [D:\git\ivan\PowerToys\src\modules\launcher\Wox.Infrastructure\Image\ImageLoader.cs::74]
