[2021-02-05 17:27:04.1697] [INFO] [Wox.Infrastructure.Storage.WoxJsonStorage`1[[Wox.Infrastructure.UserSettings.PowerToysRunSettings, Wox.Infrastructure, Version=0.0.1.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null]].Save] [D:\git\ivan\PowerToys\src\modules\launcher\Wox.Infrastructure\Storage\JsonStorage`1.cs::133]
