The `[...]` after the `[INFO]` (in the first log entry it's `[Wox.Infrastructure.Stopwatch.Normal]`) is not providing anything we may need, the source file with the line number is more than enough

We can also remove the `|` at the beginning of the line and as a separator (replace it with a space or ` - `)
```
