I think here we should use the same text like on the other settings pages. Please move the text/name of the radio buttons into the resource file. Strings should be localisable @aaron-junker
This string could be localized. It is within resource file. Ok my mistake. I'm only a triager.😅 This should be a settings group-section title: "Appearance".

