 can anyone help me about the spelling pattern?

my pattern dosn't work
```
# Test line with hexadecimal colors
\[DataRow\("[0-9A-F]{6}", \d{3}, \d{3}, \d{3}\)\]
\[DataRow\("[0-9A-F]{6}", \d{3}.\d{1}, \d{3}.\d{1}, \d{3}.\d{1}\)\]
\[DataRow\("[0-9A-F]{6}", "[0-9BCGMRY]", \d{3}, \d{3}\)\]
```
 The reason:
```
\[DataRow\("[0-9A-F]{6}", "[0-9BCGMRY]", \d{3}, \d{3}\)\]
```
didn't work is that the `[0-9BCGMRY]` part only asked for a single character -- but you have 2 or 3 characters (you could use `{2,3}` for that). But, `[BCGMRY]\d\d?` would probably cover that in a more precise manner. 
